[00:17.24]1. If we have listened to Christ, will we show it?
[00:25.48]His teaching shines as it shows us the way.
[00:31.74]It makes us happy to hear and to know it,
[00:37.76]But we’ll be blessed if we know and obey.
[00:45.36](Chorus)
[00:46.58]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[00:51.32]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[00:57.52]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[01:04.66]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[01:19.50]2. Our way of life, like a house, gives protection
[01:26.28]When it is built on the rock, not on sand.
[01:32.62]If we apply Jesus’ loving direction,
[01:38.60]We’ll build a life which on bedrock will stand.
[01:47.48](Chorus)
[01:47.48]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[01:52.88]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[01:59.92]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[02:05.78]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[02:56.12]3. Just as a tree rooted deep by the waters
[03:02.64]Gives of its fruit when each season arrives,
[03:09.22]If we obey as God’s own sons and daughters,
[03:15.30]We’ll all be blessed and enjoy endless lives.
[03:22.68](Chorus)
[03:24.10]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[03:28.84]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[03:36.26]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[03:44.72]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
